  "instructions": [
    "Combine the chopped anchovies, rice vinegar, honey, ginger, garlic, salt, and black pepper in a large bowl.",
    "Add the chopped parsley, dill, and pickled vegetables to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together the coconut cream and lemon juice until smooth.",
    "Add the coconut cream mixture to the bowl with the anchovy mixture and toss to combine.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, garnish with additional parsley and dill if desired.",
    "Spoon the Kissed creamy Turkish anchovies bowl into individual serving bowls and serve chilled."
  ],
